flowchart TD
    classDef blue fill:#E3F2FD,stroke:#1976D2,stroke-width:2px,color:#0D47A1
    classDef orange fill:#FFF3E0,stroke:#F57C00,stroke-width:2px,color:#E65100
    classDef green fill:#E8F5E9,stroke:#388E3C,stroke-width:2px,color:#1B5E20
    classDef purple fill:#F3E5F5,stroke:#7B1FA2,stroke-width:2px,color:#4A148C
    classDef red fill:#FBE9E7,stroke:#D84315,stroke-width:2px,color:#BF360C
    classDef yellow fill:#FFFDE7,stroke:#F9A825,stroke-width:2px,color:#F57F17
    classDef err fill:#FFEBEE,stroke:#C62828,stroke-width:2px,color:#B71C1C
    classDef teal fill:#E0F7FA,stroke:#00838F,stroke-width:2px,color:#006064

    %% WHAT THE USER DOES

    U1([U1 - User opens the page]):::blue
    U2[U2 - Types their business name]:::blue
    U3[U3 - Google suggests matching businesses]:::green
    U4[U4 - Picks their business from the list\nCity and website fill in automatically]:::blue
    U5[U5 - Hits the scan button]:::blue
    U6[U6 - Business name + city + website\nsent to a scan agent with SEO data]:::blue

    U1 --> U2 --> U3 --> U4 --> U5 --> U6

    %% LOADING SCREEN

    U6 --> S1([S1 - Loading screen appears]):::blue
    S1 --> S2[S2 - Progress bar fills up\nstops at 90 pct until scan finishes]:::blue
    S1 --> S3[S3 - Discovery messages appear one by one\nProfile found, Competitors found,\nGaps detected, Building report\nMake these discovery messages more intense: \nYou're missing 300 calls from x keyword, x company outranking you by 10 positions for x keyword, etc.]:::blue
    S1 --> A1

    %% SAFETY CHECK

    A1[A1 - Scan starts on the server]:::orange
    A1 --> A2{A2 - Too many scans from this user?\n3 per hour max}:::orange
    A2 -->|Yes blocked| E1[E1 - Shows error:\nTry again later]:::err
    A2 -->|No continue| G1

    %% FIND THE BUSINESS ON GOOGLE

    G1[G1 - Search Google for the business\nSwiftHand Painting Sandy UT]:::green
    G1 -->|Not found on Google| E2[E2 - Shows error:\nBusiness not found]:::err
    G1 -->|Found| G2[G2 - Get the Google listing ID]:::green
    G2 --> G3[G3 - Pull full business details:\nRating, review count, photos,\naddress, phone, website, category]:::green
    G3 --> G4[G4 - Save as profile:\nSwiftHand Painting\n4.8 stars / 284 reviews / 10 photos\nHas website / Has phone / No description\nplus grab their Google profile photo]:::yellow

    %% SPLIT INTO TWO PARALLEL JOBS

    G4 --> P1([P1 - Two jobs run at the same time]):::orange

    %% JOB 1: AI GRADES THE PROFILE

    P1 --> O1[O1 - AI reads the profile data]:::purple
    O1 --> O2[O2 - AI scores it 0-100\nDeducts points for:\nFew reviews, no website,\nno phone, few photos,\nno description, low rating]:::purple
    O2 --> O3[O3 - AI writes:\n- Visibility score: 70\n- Summary paragraph\n- 5 missed opportunities\n- 5 to 7 fix recommendations\n- 3 post ideas\n- 3 QandA suggestions]:::yellow

    %% JOB 2: FIND WHAT PEOPLE SEARCH FOR

    P1 --> K1[K1 - Create 5 basic search terms\npainter sandy / painter near me\nbest painter sandy etc.\nWe must not just look for local keywords like painters in area, we must find the top commercial intent painting keywords for all the areas they serve based on their website service areas and GBP service areas.]:::red
    K1 --> K2[K2 - Ask DataForSEO:\nWhat do people actually search\nrelated to these terms?\nReturns 30-50 real keywords\nwith real monthly search counts\nAsk Data SEO to give us the top 3 volume keywords out of the 20 we gave, and find 5 more top keywords for the entire area they search and their top competitors for each of those keywords and where their company ranks for them.]:::red
    K2 --> K3{K3 - Does the business have a website?}:::red
    K3 -->|Yes| K4[K4 - Also ask DataForSEO:\nWhat keywords does Google\nconnect to this website?\nAdds more real keywords]:::red
    K3 -->|No| K5[K5 - Skip, just use\nthe keywords we have]:::red
    K4 --> K6[K6 - Combine all keywords\nremove duplicates]:::yellow
    K5 --> K6

    %% CHECK HOW MANY PEOPLE SEARCH EACH

    K6 --> V1[V1 - Get monthly search counts\nfor each keyword\nTry city-level data first]:::red
    V1 --> V2{V2 - Got data for\nmost keywords?}:::red
    V2 -->|Yes| V5
    V2 -->|No| V3[V3 - Try state-level data instead]:::red
    V3 --> V4{V4 - Got data now?}:::red
    V4 -->|Yes| V5
    V4 -->|No| V6[V6 - Try national data\nor use estimates]:::red
    V6 --> V5[V5 - Pick the top 10 keywords\nwith the highest search volume\nTop 8 - 3 local with minimum volume of 100 and 5 more statewide or for the entire area they search higher volume like near me.]:::yellow

    %% CHECK WHO RANKS FOR EACH KEYWORD

    V5 --> R1[R1 - Google each of the 10 keywords\nCheck the top 20 results for each\nAll 10 searches happen at the same time]:::red
    R1 --> R2[R2 - For each keyword:\n- Where does SwiftHand rank?\n- Who else shows up?]:::red
    R2 --> R3[R3 - Tally up all the businesses\nthat keep appearing in results\nIgnore Yelp, Angi, directories etc.]:::red
    R3 --> R4[R4 - The business that ranks\nhighest most often =\nyour no.1 competitor]:::yellow
    R4 --> R5[R5 - Find keywords where\nthat competitor beats you\nor you do not show up at all]:::red
    R5 --> R6[R6 - Estimate how many clicks\nyou are losing on each keyword\nbased on ranking position]:::red
    R6 --> R7[R7 - Total it all up:\n- Gap keywords list\n- Primary competitor name\n- Top 5 competitors\n- Total missed clicks\nYou're missing out on x amount of calls.]:::yellow

    %% GET THE COMPETITORS REAL PROFILE - 15 MILE RADIUS

    O3 --> C1([C1 - Now find the competitor on Google\nSearching 15-mile radius from your location]):::orange
    R7 --> C1

    C1 --> C2[C2 - Try A: Search Google for\nthe SERP competitor by name\nwithin 15 miles of your business\nnot just same street or city]:::green
    C2 -->|Found| C5
    C2 -->|Not found| C3[C3 - Try B: Search best painter\nwithin 15-mile radius\npick the top result that is not you]:::green
    C3 -->|Found| C5
    C3 -->|Not found| C4[C4 - Try C: Make a placeholder\nslightly better stats than you\nso there is always a comparison]:::yellow
    C4 --> C5[C5 - Competitor profile ready:\nName, rating, reviews, photos\nwebsite, phone, Google photo\nfrom wider 15mi service area]:::yellow

    %% PACKAGE EVERYTHING UP

    C5 --> F1[F1 - Bundle everything together]:::orange
    F1 --> F2[F2 - Your profile vs competitor profile\nAll gap keywords + missed clicks]:::yellow
    F1 --> F3[F3 - AI score + summary\n+ opportunities + recommendations]:::yellow
    F1 --> F4[F4 - Post ideas + QandA suggestions]:::yellow
    F2 --> F5[F5 - Send it all to the browser]:::orange
    F3 --> F5
    F4 --> F5

    %% RESULTS PAGE

    F5 --> T1[T1 - Progress bar hits 100 pct\nPage flips to results]:::blue

    T1 --> D1([D1 - RESULTS PAGE]):::teal
    D1 --> D2[D2 - Big headline:\nYou are invisible for X of Y keywords\nhomeowners search to find painters]:::teal
    D2 --> D3[D3 - Missed calls card:\nAbout X calls per month going\nto your competitors instead]:::teal
    D3 --> D4[D4 - Visibility score:\nCircle showing 70 out of 100\nRed = bad / Amber = okay / Green = good]:::teal
    D4 --> D5[D5 - You vs Competitor side by side:\nBoth Google photos as logos\nRating / Reviews / Photos\nWebsite Y or N / Phone Y or N\nGreen = you are winning\nRed = you are losing]:::teal
    D5 --> D6[D6 - Biggest keyword you are missing:\nThe no.1 opportunity with search volume\nand your current rank or not ranked]:::teal
    D6 --> D7[D7 - AI summary:\nPlain English paragraph about\nwhat is good and what is hurting you]:::teal
    D7 --> D8[D8 - Big button:\nShow Me How to Fix This]:::teal
    D8 --> D9([D9 - Choice page:\nDIY Plan or Free AI Optimization]):::blue